{"title":"Goblin Culling","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\"><span class=\"q-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><b>This quest is not fully written yet.</b> Steps, items or dialogue may be missing.</span></span>Goblins in the Rustpick Mine are breeding faster than we can count. The Binxonia watch pays for twelve. Report to me when it&#39;s done. (Mira, Binxonia watch)</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/mira\">Mira</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"mira\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Short</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>0</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><p>Nothing to bring in the steps recorded so far.</p></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/mira\">Mira</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors near Binxonia)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"mira\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Kill 12 goblins in the Rustpick Mine <span class=\"muted\">(12)</span></li><li value=\"3\">Report to Mira in Binxonia <span class=\"muted\">at -2, -2</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"-2|-2|Report to Mira in Binxonia\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>60</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>2,000</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-talk\"><h2>What Mira says</h2><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Mira:</b> Twelve. That should keep them down in the dark for a day or so.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Mira:</b> The watch pays what it posts. Come back tomorrow, there are always more of them.</p></div></section><section id=\"g-end\"><h2>Handing it in</h2><p class=\"q-end\"><i>\"That&#39;ll hold them for a day. The board will say when it doesn&#39;t.\"</i></p></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>Goblin Culling</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-goblin-culling\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-goblin-culling\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-goblin-culling\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-goblin-culling\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-goblin-culling\" data-g-jump=\"g-talk\">What Mira says</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-goblin-culling\" data-g-jump=\"g-end\">Handing it in</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}